#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:4
msgid "How to: add a custom optimizer"
msgstr "操作指南：添加自定义优化器"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:6
msgid ""
"The local training step is pluggable: fl-sim keeps its own optimizer "
"registry, and any optimizer registered there can be selected by name in "
"the client config. This is the lightest of the three how-tos — the "
"complete example is 48 lines (``test-files/custom_optimizer.py``, "
"exercised in CI via ``test-files/custom_conf.yml``)."
msgstr ""
"本地训练步是可插拔的：fl-sim 维护自己的优化器注册表，任何注册过的优化器都能在客户端"
"配置里按名字选用。这是三篇操作指南里最轻的一篇——完整示例只有 48 行"
"（``test-files/custom_optimizer.py``，经 ``test-files/custom_conf.yml`` 在 CI 中执行）。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:13
msgid "Where optimizers plug in"
msgstr "优化器接在哪里"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:15
msgid ""
"fl-sim's local optimizers live in :mod:`fl_sim.optimizers` and subclass "
":class:`~fl_sim.optimizers.base.ProxSGD` — the proximal SGD base that "
"supports the extra local-training knobs federated algorithms need "
"(proximal terms, variance-reduction buffers passed by "
"``optimizer.step(...)``, per the custom algorithm in :ref:`howto-custom-"
"algorithm`)."
msgstr ""
"fl-sim 的本地优化器都在 :mod:`fl_sim.optimizers` 里，继承 "
":class:`~fl_sim.optimizers.base.ProxSGD`——这个近端 SGD 基类支持联邦算法需要的额外本地"
"训练旋钮（近端项、由 ``optimizer.step(...)`` 传入的方差削减缓冲区，用法见 "
":ref:`howto-custom-algorithm` 的自定义算法）。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:22
msgid ""
"Registration makes the optimizer discoverable by name — the same pattern "
"as algorithms and datasets:"
msgstr "注册让优化器可按名字发现——与算法、数据集是同一模式："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:30
msgid ""
"This example wraps ``FedProxOptimizer``'s behavior under a new name; a "
"genuinely new optimizer overrides the ``ProxSGD`` step methods instead of"
" the constructor."
msgstr ""
"这个例子把 ``FedProxOptimizer`` 的行为换了个名字；真正全新的优化器应覆写 ``ProxSGD`` "
"的 step 方法而不是构造器。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:35
msgid "Use it"
msgstr "使用"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:37
msgid ""
"Registered optimizers are referenced by name in the client config — "
"programmatically:"
msgstr "注册过的优化器在客户端配置里按名字引用——编程方式："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:44
msgid "or in a YAML experiment matrix:"
msgstr "或在 YAML 实验矩阵里："

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:52
msgid ""
"The name is resolved through :func:`~fl_sim.optimizers.get_optimizer` at "
"client setup (a trailing ``Optimizer`` suffix is optional); an "
"unregistered name fails there with ``Optimizer ... is not registered``."
msgstr ""
"名字在客户端初始化时经 :func:`~fl_sim.optimizers.get_optimizer` 解析（结尾的 "
"``Optimizer`` 后缀可省略）；未注册的名字会在此报错 ``Optimizer ... is not registered`` 。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:57
msgid "Caveats"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:59
msgid ""
"the optimizer is constructed **once per client per run**; anything "
"stateful it keeps lives for the whole federated run;"
msgstr "优化器 **每次运行中每个客户端只构造一次** ；它保存的任何状态会贯穿整个联邦运行；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:61
msgid ""
"some algorithms fix the client optimizer in their client-config "
"validators (e.g. the FedProx family selects ``FedProx`` / ``FedProx_VR`` "
"from its ``vr`` flag) — for those algorithms the ``optimizer`` config "
"field is ignored by design;"
msgstr ""
"某些算法在客户端配置的 validator 里固定了本地优化器（如 FedProx 家族由 ``vr`` 标志选择 "
"``FedProx`` / ``FedProx_VR`` ）——对这些算法， ``optimizer`` 配置字段被设计性地忽略；"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:65
msgid ""
"the server-side optimizers (FedAdam, FedYogi, … in the FedOpt family) are"
" a different mechanism — those are selected through the server config's "
"``optimizer`` field and are not part of this registry."
msgstr ""
"服务器侧优化器（FedOpt 家族的 FedAdam、FedYogi 等）是另一套机制——经服务器配置的 "
"``optimizer`` 字段选择，不在本注册表内。"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:71
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/howto-custom-optimizer.rst:73
msgid ""
":ref:`howto-custom-algorithm` — when the *algorithm*, not just the "
"optimizer, is what's new."
msgstr ":ref:`howto-custom-algorithm`——如果新的不只是优化器，而是 *算法本身* 。"

